    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeholamu ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yehoshafati wifuula hamò na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ūjīkwa mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi. Ng'witūnja wakwe Yeholamu wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe ūbiza ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A baana ba ng'wawe ū Yeholamu a bitūnja ba ng'wa Yehoshafati baalī, Azalia, Yehieli, Zakalia, Azaliahu, Mikaeli, na Shefatia; a bose benaba baalī bitūnja ba ng'wa Yehoshafati ntemi wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū saabo walī wabinha shakwinha shingī, feza na zahabu, na shikolo sha būyaga sha mpango ntaale, hamò na mizengo īyo yalī īpīndīlījiwe ndugu ū mu Yuda. Alīyo ū būtemi walī wang'winha Yeholamu, nguno h'ūyo walī myalwa wakwe wa kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yeholamu aho wigasha a ha būtemi bo ng'wa ise ūpandīka nguzu, ūbabūlaga a baana ba ng'wawe pye a bose, hamò na banhū bangī a ba ng'wikūlū lya Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yeholamu ng'wenūyo aho alandya kūbiza ntemi walī na myaka makūmi adatū n'ībīlī; ūtema ikanza lya myaka īnaane ū mu Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Washimīzaga mu kūlondeela nzīla ja batemi ba Isilaeli; walondeelaga nhūngwa ja numba ya ng'wa Ahabu, nguno akantoola nshīke o ng'wa Ahabu; wīta yabūbi ū miso ga ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo kūlw'ilagane īlo SEEBA walī wabeeja na Daūdi, ū SEEBA atīkenaagūlile ī numba yenīyo. Nguno walī wisagīja gīkī akūleka tala kūlwa ng'wa Daūdi, hamò nī shibyalīlwe shakwe shikū jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jakwe ū Yeholamu ī Edomu yūlema ū kūbiza ha sīlīlī ya būsugi wa Yuda, nayo yūtūūla ntemi wayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yeholamu ūja koi hamò na bataale ba bashilikale bakwe, na magogoteni gakwe ga būlūgū; aho alī kwenūko a mabità ga Baedomu gūmpīndya hamò na a bataale ba bashilikale bakwe. Alīyo aho wila ū būjikū ūbūūka ūnyeenyeeka ūpūlūgūka wīnga ko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūshisha na leelo yene ī Edomu yalema ū kūbiza ha sīlīlī ya būsugi wa Yuda. Nī Libuna yūgoma ū mu makanza genayo, nguno ū Yeholamu akang'wība ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo akabeeja na mapandī ga higūlya ū mu ngūlū ja Yuda, ūbenheleja a banhū ba Yuda kwisosohaja mu nzīla ja wilamīlīja, ūbenheleja kūtala ū mu nzīla ya ng'wa SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliya kūng'hūgūla Yeholamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwitulwa ū Yeholamu wapandīka nyalūba ya kūfuma kūlī ng'hangi Eliya; īlīhaya, “Ū SEEBA ū Mulungu wa nkūlūgenji wako Daūdi alīhaya gīkī, ‘Walekile ū kūshimīzīla ū mu nzīla ja ng'wa so ū Yehoshafati, nūūlū ū Asa ū ntemi wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūkūshimīzīlaga mu nzīla ja batemi ba Isilaeli; na a banhū ba Yuda wabenhelegije kwisosohaja mu nzīla ja wilamīlīja gīt'ūmo yītīla numba ya ng'wa Ahabu. Hama na a baana ba ng'wing'we wababūlagile, banhū ba mu numba ya ng'wa so gete, abo baalī bawiza kūkūheeba ū bebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī haha ū SEEBA alī hihī kūbatūla ha bbahu a banhū bako, a bitūnja bako na a bake bako, nī shikolo shako shose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū bebe ng'wenekīlī ūkūsaata munda, būsaatu wa makanza malīhu, ū kū ng'halīlo yaho ūkūfuma ngongo!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūbasaja Bafilisiti na Baalabu abo bikalaga bbihī na Bakushi, būnzanzamukīla ū Yeholamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bīyūbūkīla ī Yuda, būshibūūcha pyī ī shikolo īsho bakapandīka ū mu numba y'ikūlū, būja nasho; būbajana na a bitūnja hamò na a bake bakwe. Atalekelilwe ng'witūnja, ūlū atī Ahazia dūhū, ūyo walī ndo wa kūmalīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya yenīyī, ū SEEBA ūntūla ū Yeholamu, ūsaata būsaatu wa munda būtī wa kūpīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza aho lyaja līlongeja kūja kū būtongi, yahayūshika myaka ībīlī, ūfuma ngongo kūlwa būsaatu wenūbo; ūcha mu kūsaatwa kūtaale no! A banhū bakwe batapembile moto gwa koolekeja kūnkūja gīt'ūmo baalī bīītīla kū bataale bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yeholamu walī na myaka makūmi adatū n'ībīlī aho alandya kūtema; ūtema ū mu Yelusalemu ikanza lya myaka īnaane. Aho waacha, atapīnīhalile munhū nūūlū ūmò; ūjīkwa mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi, alīyo ītī ū mu shigila ūmo bajīkīlagwa batemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
